+| Macro | Copies | Profile |
+|---|---:|---|
+| A1 | 6443903466000 | 28, 1, 28, 28, 42922 |
+| A3 | 560756196000 | 113 singletons + 55, 644, 41468 |
+| A5 | 560756196000 | 29 singletons + 25, 648 |
